[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8400.55, "timestamp": "02:20:00", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8403.349, "timestamp": "02:20:03", "text": "ああ、私のエンドースメントがオーバーロードしている。 ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8405.03, "timestamp": "02:20:05", "text": "このゲームはすごく多くのものを必要とするか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8406.23, "timestamp": "02:20:06", "text": "何かです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8408.71, "timestamp": "02:20:08", "text": "ええ、だから私は一番低い金額でやっているんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8412.07, "timestamp": "02:20:12", "text": "ミア、最低でも「オーマイ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8414.79, "timestamp": "02:20:14", "text": "ゴッド」ではない。 待って、もしかして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8417.03, "timestamp": "02:20:17", "text": "墜落したの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8419.99, "timestamp": "02:20:19", "text": "いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8423.51, "timestamp": "02:20:23", "text": "私が止めます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8433.59, "timestamp": "02:20:33", "text": "ヒーラーは残しておかないといけないな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8451.91, "timestamp": "02:20:51", "text": "ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8455.83, "timestamp": "02:20:55", "text": "今が彼らを止める良い機会かもしれません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8457.349, "timestamp": "02:20:57", "text": "くそ、今の私にはサイロックのプレイ方法が全く分からない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8459.67, "timestamp": "02:20:59", "text": "。"}]